{"id":"7e4e35763e70ecc9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-arithstrict.md","title":"算术层级的严格性","display":"thm-arithstrict — 算术层级的严格性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-arithstrict","aliases":["20-thm-arithstrict"],"display":"thm-arithstrict — 算术层级的严格性","chapter":"4","section":"4.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Corollary 4.2.3","source_pdf_pages":[121],"source_printed_pages":[85],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-post]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-arithstrict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-arithstrict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arithstrict — 算术层级的严格性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 4.2.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>121</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>85</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a015f8b574fd0061\" href=\"?note=a015f8b574fd0061\" title=\"20-thm-post\">20-thm-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f7cd94927463198\" href=\"?note=0f7cd94927463198\" title=\"20-thm-hierarchy-closure\">20-thm-hierarchy-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a015f8b574fd0061\" href=\"?note=a015f8b574fd0061\" title=\"20-thm-post\">20-thm-post</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f7cd94927463198\" href=\"?note=0f7cd94927463198\" title=\"20-thm-hierarchy-closure\">20-thm-hierarchy-closure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithstrict}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^0_n\\ne\\Pi^0_n,\\qquad\n\\Delta^0_n\\subsetneq\\Sigma^0_n,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^0_n\\subsetneq\\Delta^0_{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithstrict}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^0_n\\ne\\Pi^0_n,\\qquad\n\\Delta^0_n\\subsetneq\\Sigma^0_n,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^0_n\\subsetneq\\Delta^0_{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>层级包含由量词闭包定理给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n\\)</span>；若它也在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>，即属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\)</span>，Post 表征会给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}\">\\(\\varnothing^{(n)}\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}\\)</span>，与跳跃严格性矛盾。这同时给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\\ne\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\ne\\Pi_n\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n\\subsetneq\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Delta_n\\subsetneq\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 的见证。</p>\n<p>其补集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus\\varnothing^{(n)}\">\\(\\omega\\setminus\\varnothing^{(n)}\\)</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{(n)}\">\\(\\varnothing^{(n)}\\)</span> 计算，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{n+1}\">\\(\\Delta_{n+1}\\)</span>；若补集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>，原跳跃就在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>，仍矛盾。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\\subsetneq\\Delta_{n+1}\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\subsetneq\\Delta_{n+1}\\)</span>。两项严格包含各有明确见证，没有把仅有包含关系当作严格性证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 4.2.3；印刷 85 / PDF 121。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-post","status":"resolved","id":"a015f8b574fd0061","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hierarchy-closure","status":"resolved","id":"0f7cd94927463198","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-post","status":"resolved","id":"a015f8b574fd0061","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hierarchy-closure","status":"resolved","id":"0f7cd94927463198","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithstrict}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^0_n\\ne\\Pi^0_n,\\qquad\n\\Delta^0_n\\subsetneq\\Sigma^0_n,\\qquad\n\\Sigma^0_n\\subsetneq\\Delta^0_{n+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n\\ne\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_n\\subsetneq\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus\\varnothing^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n\\subsetneq\\Delta_{n+1}","display":false}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"994bce235fe37ad3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-thm-arithstrict]]；see [[20-thm-arithmetic-preimage]]。"},{"id":"bf2ceaa7f092f9e7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-thm-arithstrict]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-449","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-arithstrict]] — 章 4；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-449","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-arithstrict]]"}],"outgoing":["a015f8b574fd0061","2ea8548c98f572c3","0f7cd94927463198"]}